      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>spec.priority</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Optional: Specifies the priority of the catalog in relation to the other catalogs on the cluster. For more information, see "Catalog selection by priority".</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>spec.source.image.pollIntervalMinutes</code></dt>
