      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the catalog image in the <code>spec.source.image.ref</code> field.</p></dd>
      </dl>
      </li>
      <li>
      Add the catalog to your cluster by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc apply -f my-redhat-operators.yaml"} lang="terminal" />
