      <h2 id="olmv1-disabling-a-default-catalog_managing-catalogs" class="group scroll-mt-20">Disabling a default catalog<a href="#olmv1-disabling-a-default-catalog_managing-catalogs" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">You can disable the Red Hat-provided catalogs that are included with OpenShift Container Platform by default.</p>
      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ul>
